&lt;p&gt;Please click the link for our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uAKvHVSRsqZ83CGhM3_3Dc6RPsXwlTdmwdUH7msHkVM/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
